 \* No two frames hold the same non-zero page_id
 UniquePages == \A f1, f2 \in 1..NUM_FRAMES :
     f1 /= f2 /\ frames[f1].page_id /= 0
     => frames[f1].page_id /= frames[f2].page_id
 
 \* Checks so that htable doesnt have 2 different pointers to same frame
 HashTableNoDuplicates == \A p1, p2 \in 1..NUM_PAGES :
     p1 /= p2 /\ hash_table[p1] /= 0
     => hash_table[p1] /= hash_table[p2]

UniquePages == 
    (\A t \in 1..NUM_THREADS : pc[t] = "Done")
    => \A f1, f2 \in 1..NUM_FRAMES :
        f1 /= f2 /\ frames[f1].page_id /= 0
        => frames[f1].page_id /= frames[f2].page_id

     \* Number of non-zero hash table entries equals number of frames with non-zero page_id
 HashTableConsistent ==
     Cardinality({p \in 1..NUM_PAGES : hash_table[p] /= 0})
     = Cardinality({f \in 1..NUM_FRAMES : frames[f].page_id /= 0})